custom colors override
	assets/scss/_custom.scss

when changing background color
	check /layouts/_default/redirect.html
	to change the color of the load flash

book-entry toc-track-entry
blog-entry toc-track-entry
	this is the class template used for reading/blogs, in toc.js there is
	DOCS.querySelectorAll('[class*="toc-track-"]')
	so any new pages that will include entries with the toc, needs to
	adhere to this format for the toc to work properly
